        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dick Miller, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Linda Hamilton, Roger Corman, Richard Devon, Susan Cabot\n- Films: Gremlins, The Explorers, Piranha, The Howling, A Bucket of Blood, The Little Shop of Horrors, Chopping Mall, Night of the Creeps, The Terminator, The 'Burbs, Small Soldiers, War of the Satellites\n- Roles: Terminator, Sarah Connor\n- Concepts: cyborg assassin, time travel, post-apocalyptic future, machines\n\nFacts:\n- Dick Miller's main roles have been in films including Gremlins, The Explorers, Piranha, The Howling, A Bucket of Blood, The Little Shop of Horrors, Chopping Mall, Night of the Creeps, The Terminator, The 'Burbs, and Small Soldiers.\n- War of the Satellites was produced and directed by Roger Corman and stars Richard Devon, Dick Miller, and Susan Cabot.\n- The Terminator stars Arnold Schwarzenegger as the Terminator, a cyborg assassin sent back in time from 2029 to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor.\n- Linda Hamilton plays Sarah Connor in The Terminator.\n- In The Terminator, Sarah Connor's son will one day become a savior against machines in a post-apocalyptic future.",
